OVE OPERATIONAL EFFICIENCIES AND SUPPORT EXCELLENT CUSTOMER SERVICE FOR WATER AND WASTEWATER CUSTOMERS. “WITH THE COMP'}{'symbol': 'AME', 'date': '2021-10-27 08:30:00', 'title': 'AMETEK RELEASES 2021 SUSTAINABILITY REPORT', 'text': "BERWYN, PA., OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMETEK, INC. (NYSE: AME) TODAY PUBLISHED ITS 2021 SUSTAINABILITY REPORT, HIGHLIGHTING THE COMPANY'S COMMITMENT TO ENVIRONMENTAL STEWARDSHIP, SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY, DIVERSITY AND INCLUSION, AND SOUND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE."}{'symbol': 'APH', 'date': '2021-10-27 08:00:00', 'title': 'AMPHENOL REPORTS RECORD THIRD QUARTER 2021 RESULTS AND ANNOUNCES DIVIDEND INCREASE', 'text': "WALLINGFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMPHENOL CORPORATION (NYSE:APH) TODAY REPORTED THIRD QUARTER 2021 RESULTS. “WE ARE PLEASED TO HAVE CLOSED THE THIRD QUARTER WITH SALES AND ADJUSTED DILUTED EPS2 EXCEEDING THE HIGH END OF OUR GUIDANCE,” SAID AMPHENOL PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, R. ADAM NORWITT. “SALES INCREASED BY A STRONG 21% IN THE QUARTER, WITH BROAD-BASED GROWTH ACROSS MOST OF OUR END MARKETS, INCLUDING CONTRIBUTIONS FROM THE COMPANY'S ACQUISITION PROGRAM. “DURING THE THIRD QUA"}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2021-10-27 09:00:00', 'title': 'ANSYS COLLABORATES WITH TSMC TO DELIVER THERMAL ANALYSIS SOLUTION FOR 3D-IC DESIGNS', 'text': "PITTSBURGH, OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 / KEY HIGHLIGHTS THE COMPANIES COLLABORATED TO DELIVER A COMPREHENSIVE HIERARCHICAL THERMAL ANALYSIS SOLUTION FOR TSMC 3DFABRIC USING REDHAWK-SC ELECTROTHERMAL TSMC ENABLED ANSYS REDHAWK-SC™ FOR POWER INTEGRITY (EM/IR) SIGNOFF OF 3DFABRIC DESIGNS TSMC AND ANSYS (NASDAQ: ANSS) COLLABORATED TO CREATE A COMPREHENSIVE THERMAL ANALYSIS SOLUTION FOR MULTI-DIE DESIGNS BUILT WITH TSMC 3DFABRIC™, TSMC'S COMPREHENSIVE FAMILY OF 3D SILICON STACKING AND ADVANCED PACKAGING TECHNOLOGIES. THIS SOLUTION IS BUILT ON ANSYS TOOLS TO SIMULATE THE TEMPERATURE OF 3D AND 2.5D ELECTRONIC SYSTEMS CONTAINING MULTIPLE CHIPS STACKED CLOSELY TOGETHER USING THE ADVANCED TSMC 3DFABRIC TECHNOLOGIES."}{'symbol': 'AJG', 'date': '2021-10-27 09:00:00', 'title': 'ARTHUR J. GALLAGHER & CO. ACQUIRES THE VANDYKE GROUP, INC.', 'text': 'ROLLING MEADOWS, ILL., OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ARTHUR J.'}{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2021-10-27 11:17:00', 'title': 'FIRSTNET SURPASSES 2.8 MILLION CONNECTIONS AND ESTABLISHES MARKET LEADERSHIP WITH LAW ENFORCEMENT', 'text': "DALLAS, OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHAT'S THE NEWS?\xa0A MOMENTOUS 3RD QUARTER SAW ACCELERATED ADOPTION FROM PUBLIC SAFETY."}{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2021-10-27 10:13:00', 'title': 'AT&T FIRST TO DELIVER BOTH HIGH AND LOW-BAND 5G CONNECTIVITY TO GE RESEARCH CAMPUS', 'text': "NISKAYUNA, N.Y., OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHAT'S THE NEWS?"}{'symbol': 'ADP', 'date': '2021-10-27 09:00:00', 'title': 'U.S. WAGE GROWTH INCREASED BY 3.3 PERCENT, ALIGNED WITH PRE-PANDEMIC GROWTH, WHILE WAGES FOR U.S. JOB SWITCHERS INCREASED 6.6 PERCENT SINCE SEPTEMBER 2020 TO MEET DEMAND FOR WORKERS', 'text': 'ROSELAND, N.J., OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THIRD QUARTER U.S. WAGE GROWTH INCREASED 3.3 PERCENT, IN LINE WITH GROWTH IN THE MONTHS LEADING UP TO THE PANDEMIC; HOWEVER, WAGE GROWTH FOR JOB SWITCHERS INCREASED 6.6 PERCENT SINCE SEPTEMBER 2020 ACCORDING TO THE ADP RESEARCH INSTITUTE ® \xa0WORKFORCE VITALITY REPORT\xa0(WVR) RELEASED TODAY.'}{'symbol': 'ADP', 'date': '2021-10-27 08:15:00', 'title': 'OCTOBER 2021 ADP NATIONAL EMPLOYMENT REPORT®, ADP SMALL BUSINESS REPORT® AND ADP NATIONAL FRANCHISE REPORT® TO BE RELEASED ON WEDNESDAY, NOVEMBER 3, 2021', 'text': 'ROSELAND, N.J., OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHAT:\xa0 ADP RESEARCH INSTITUTE ®\xa0WILL RELEASE THE OCTOBER FINDINGS OF THE\xa0ADP NATIONAL EMPLOYMENT REPORT,\xa0ADP SMALL BUSINESS REPORT\xa0AND\xa0ADP NATIONAL FRANCHISE REPORT\xa0ON\xa0 WEDNESDAY, NOVEMBER 3, 2021 AT\xa08:15 A.M.'}{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2021-10-27 08:12:00', 'title': 'BAKER HUGHES ANNOUNCES TRANSFER OF STOCK EXCHANGE LISTING TO NASDAQ', 'text': 'HOUSTON & LONDON--(B